---
---

<section id="section-contacts-topics" class="vn-contacts-topics">
  <div class="vn-container">
    <div class="vn-grid-12">
      <div class="vn-contacts-topics__header">
        <h2 class="vn-contacts-topics__h2">С какими вопросами можно обращаться</h2>
        <p class="vn-contacts-topics__lead">
          Обращаться стоит не только когда уже выбрали квартиру. Лучше прийти
          раньше — когда нужно разобраться в районе, сценарии или маршруте сделки.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tags">
        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18"/><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/><path d="M18 12h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M10 9h4"/><path d="M10 13h4"/><path d="M10 17h4"/></svg>
          <span>Выбор новостройки в Краснодаре</span>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 22h18"/><path d="M6 18v-6l6-4 6 4v6"/><path d="M12 8v10"/></svg>
          <span>Покупка по военной ипотеке</span>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5.43 5.43A8.06 8.06 0 0 0 4 10c0 6 8 12 8 12"/><path d="M17.37 17.37A8.06 8.06 0 0 0 20 10a8 8 0 0 0-13.36-5.8"/><line x1="2" y1="2" x2="22" y2="22"/></svg>
          <span>Дистанционная покупка</span>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          <span>Переезд позже</span>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
          <span>Покупка под сдачу до переезда</span>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-topics__tag">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
          <span>Сложная ситуация по срокам или документам</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="vn-contacts-topics__subnote">
        Это неполный список — Михаил разбирает любые вопросы,
        связанные с новостройками Краснодара по военной ипотеке.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vn-contacts-topics {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__header {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__tags {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    transition: background 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .vn-contacts-topics__tag:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-primary) 30%, transparent);
  }
  .vn-contacts-topics__tag svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .vn-contacts-topics__subnote {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .vn-contacts-topics__tags {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .vn-contacts-topics {
      padding: 64px 0;
    }
    .vn-contacts-topics__tags {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
